abstract: >-
  A human-led, transparently AI-assisted framework for moral reasoning under radical difference,
  with a constitutional charter, decision procedure, evaluation rubric, and adversarial scenarios
  for testing value generalization, agency, non-domination, moral uncertainty, and coexistence.
